## Standards loading

- Prefer Cursor **globs** on `rules/standards/**`
- If globs miss (chat-only), Kesh explicitly names relevant standard modules in the plan
- DB engine modules only when that engine is evidenced in the repo

## Money Lens

- Advisory trade-off analysis for FEATURE / ARCHITECTURE / large REFACTOR
- **Must not hard-stop** BUG_FIX, SECURITY_CHANGE, PRODUCTION_INCIDENT, mandatory reliability work

## Anti-patterns

- ❌ Running all 15 agents for a one-line explanation
- ❌ Downgrading CRITICAL → FAST to save tokens
- ❌ Skipping Bhishma on shipped code changes
- ❌ Passing entire chat / all standards into every Task
- ❌ Claiming parallel runs without concurrent Task invocations
- ❌ Fabricating test or scanner results
- ❌ Blocking a security fix because ROI &lt; 50%
- ❌ Treating STALE cache as current security/test evidence
